          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "The run-down Kestrel Cabin is in need of repair so is empty for the summer—or is it? The campers in neighboring Sparrow Cabin claim to hear mysterious sounds coming from Kestrel at night. Could it be a ghost? Everyone seems convinced. Except, maybe, the Hoot crew, who know that the story is only fit to print if they can find actual proof there’s a ghost in their midst! ",
